1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,510
In 1971, this
country didn't exist.

2
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:06,353
Today, it has the tallest
building on Earth.

3
00:00:06,393 --> 00:00:09,373
Over 4,000 years ago,
traders here send copper

4
00:00:09,413 --> 00:00:12,849
to Mesopotamia, from
a land called Magan.

5
00:00:12,889 --> 00:00:15,129
In the 7th century,
Islam arrives,

6
00:00:15,169 --> 00:00:17,261
and spreads along the coast.

7
00:00:17,301 --> 00:00:19,401
In the 1500s,
Portuguese fleets

8
00:00:19,441 --> 00:00:21,691
take control of Gulf trade.

9
00:00:21,731 --> 00:00:23,791
From 1820,
treaties with Britain

10
00:00:23,831 --> 00:00:27,792
bind the coastal emirates,
then called the Trucial States.

11
00:00:27,832 --> 00:00:31,192
Pearl diving feeds the
coast, until the 1930s,

12
00:00:31,232 --> 00:00:34,981
when cultured pearls and the
Depression crash the trade.

13
00:00:35,021 --> 00:00:38,895
Then, in 1958, oil is
found off Abu Dhabi.

14
00:00:38,935 --> 00:00:41,455
On 2 December 1971,

15
00:00:41,495 --> 00:00:43,335
six emirates unite.

16
00:00:43,375 --> 00:00:45,863
A seventh joins
early the next year.

17
00:00:45,903 --> 00:00:48,723
Today, over 11 million
people live here,

18
00:00:48,763 --> 00:00:52,174
and in 2021, its
probe reached Mars.

19
00:00:52,214 --> 00:00:55,990
Which country should
we print next?

